{"seq":17,"slug":"public-economics","title":"公共经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics","rating":{"composite":3.45,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 公共经济学\n\n公共经济学研究政府在经济中的角色——它为什么要介入市场、应当介入到何种程度，又如何通过支出与税收来影响资源配置与收入分配。它处于经济学与公共政策的交汇处，既要回答「政府应当做什么」的规范问题，也要分析「政府实际如何运作」的实证问题。从你缴纳的税款、享用的公共服务，到政府应对气候变化与贫富差距的方略，背后都有公共经济学的逻辑在运作。\n\n本 hub 面向希望理解政府经济职能的读者，无需深厚的经济学背景，循序渐进地讲解从市场失灵到税收、再到公共选择与再分配的核心理论，并落脚于现实政策的应用。\n\n第一章「基础与市场失灵」确立全 hub 的逻辑起点——竞争市场在公共物品、外部性、信息不对称与垄断等情形下会失灵，这构成政府干预的潜在理由，但政府本身也可能失灵。第二章「公共物品」剖析非竞争性与非排他性如何导致搭便车与供给不足，及最优供给的难题。第三章「外部性」剖析污染等外溢影响的机理与矫正之道（庇古税、科斯定理）。第四章「税收理论」讲税收的效率与公平原则、税负归宿、超额负担与最优税制。第五章「公共选择与再分配」把经济学用于政治、分析政府失灵、探讨收入再分配，并纵览公共经济学在现实政策中的应用与意义。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。始终把握一条主线：市场会失灵，所以可能需要政府；但政府也会失灵，所以干预须审慎权衡——公共经济学正是在「市场之手」与「政府之手」的两难之间，寻找审慎而明智的平衡。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与市场失灵","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-public-economics","title":"什么是公共经济学","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/foundations/what-is-public-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-failure","title":"市场失灵","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/foundations/market-failure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"government-role-and-failure","title":"政府的角色与政府失灵","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/foundations/government-role-and-failure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-goods","title":"公共物品","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-goods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-characteristics","title":"公共物品的两个特征","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-goods/two-characteristics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"free-rider-undersupply","title":"搭便车与供给不足","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-goods/free-rider-undersupply"},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimal-provision","title":"最优供给与偏好显示","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-goods/optimal-provision"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"externalities","title":"外部性","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/externalities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meaning-and-types","title":"外部性的含义与分类","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/externalities/meaning-and-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inefficiency","title":"外部性为何导致无效率","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/externalities/inefficiency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"remedies","title":"外部性的矫正之道","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/externalities/remedies"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"taxation","title":"税收理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/taxation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principles-efficiency-equity","title":"税收的两大原则：效率与公平","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/taxation/principles-efficiency-equity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tax-incidence","title":"税负归宿","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/taxation/tax-incidence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"deadweight-and-optimal-tax","title":"超额负担与最优税制","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/taxation/deadweight-and-optimal-tax"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"public-choice-and-redistribution","title":"公共选择与再分配","docCount":4,"url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-choice-and-redistribution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"public-choice","title":"公共选择：把经济学用于政治","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-choice-and-redistribution/public-choice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"government-failure-mechanisms","title":"政府失灵的机制","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-choice-and-redistribution/government-failure-mechanisms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"redistribution","title":"收入再分配","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-choice-and-redistribution/redistribution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications-and-significance","title":"公共经济学的应用与意义","url":"/h/economics-finance/public-economics/public-choice-and-redistribution/applications-and-significance"}]}]}